    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "fall_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "*yawn*... I was up until 3 reading this new book...#$q 62/63 fall_Fri_old#Do you read, @?#$r 62 -30 Fri_bad#Yep. The classics.#$r 63 30 Fri_good#Only Sci-fi and Fantasy#$r 62 0 Fri_bad#I like a good Romance#$r 63 -30 Fri_bad#No, I don't read books",
      "translation": "*zívne*... Do tří do rána jsem četl tuhle novou knihu...#$q 62/63 fall_Fri_old#Čteš, @?#$r 62 -30 Fri_bad#Ano. Klasiku.#$r 63 30 Fri_good#Jen sci-fi a fantasy#$r 62 0 Fri_bad#Dobré romance mě baví#$r 63 -30 Fri_bad#Ne, knihy nečtu",
      "sourceSHA256": "5d56aa6bf8e9c8449b919ed4d0e463b018b17f4b0abe311b9addae66ea5a6f58",
      "translationSHA256": "b3851b9c292f43c1201624bb0d53bbd100947e910634667472f74e2d31f6f6c5",
