    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "fall_Fri6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I've been reading a book about a farmer. Reminds me a lot of you, actually.$h#$e#Sorry if that creeps you out.$h",
      "translation": "Čtu knihu o životě jednoho farmáře. Vlastně mi tě hodně připomíná.$h#$e#Promiň, jestli ti to připadá děsivé.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "200b4fc37eb0100e27194f23e5cd6d94397dd07b849e63dd29d6d490850996c2",
      "translationSHA256": "cd5cbfc9ca0f1eb03d1a4c9487bd514b68e2c9343acdaebd8da11c112109b74a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "fall_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I was *this* close to moping in bed the entire day. Kinda wish I had, now.",
      "translation": "Byl jsem *takhle* blízko tomu, abych celý den proležel v posteli a litoval se. Teď si skoro přeju, abych to udělal.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e45039e0735de9d270123fcae72ed1a15a026fea0fcc4e5c030c48f9155a3833",
      "translationSHA256": "049444fefa6a8cf888f75a5cf9a663491154bc736ed74460c315cb2148af7346",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "fall_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The sun is coming out less and less these days... wonderful.",
      "translation": "Slunce se v poslední době ukazuje čím dál méně... Nádhera.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c3fa54ae111cd378d8a1608a16cef5d6e7674af2de1748f28300418438f5a934",
      "translationSHA256": "c2b37d74f49a82763303adb1adc82bedb3132abc80155d213df343ffd91be038",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Mon",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm enjoying this gloomy weather... although I have to say, it's a little cold.",
      "translation": "Užívám si tohle pochmurné počasí... I když musím uznat, že je trochu zima.",
      "sourceSHA256": "27ff2edf04cad1fcbe57133016a65c4828c18da802145bb30c72e38dead2dfa7",
      "translationSHA256": "6238a606d866015d489a3bca644ccd79d93b943e1dffb87721b40415677e48db",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Mon4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Nothing surprises me anymore... nothing makes me laugh.#$e#Yeah, I know... I'm being a little dramatic.",
      "translation": "Už mě nic nepřekvapuje... Nic mě nerozesměje.#$e#Jo, já vím... Trochu to dramatizuji.",
      "sourceSHA256": "7838dcafaf0a24c883226261f7f727a43eb1211a35dad9dc53cae4df644c33d6",
      "translationSHA256": "84ea36ed2baa79a21a6c444cddafc04f195f0824e4aafd2be2a06ca480abbcbb",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Mon8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Do you ever think back on your old self with shame and embarrassment?#$e#I guess it's just part of growing up.",
      "translation": "Vzpomínáš někdy na své staré já se studem a rozpaky?#$e#Asi je to prostě součást dospívání.",
      "sourceSHA256": "4c4186fdcbcbc01cc3d3c212fdb1ee30da42d51f0a0974fcc9de4f5847d2ac47",
      "translationSHA256": "5e8110c3321073bbbf1d818995fe043341dedda49262742254eea3d6c8627d72",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Tue",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hmm... I don't really have anything to say. I still don't know you very well.",
      "translation": "Hm... Vlastně nemám co říct. Pořád tě moc dobře neznám.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e986c0d92e9ad4936c287e50c652945971a995123f89fb41b9ddccca8d9adb71",
      "translationSHA256": "6f037e041d41c56461914a93a0014d6f14927918a0f3bfe5ae7e01daa7e584b7",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Tue4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey...#$b#It's hard to think of new things to talk about, sometimes. Even after you know someone.#$e#...Sorry.",
      "translation": "Ahoj...#$b#Někdy je těžké vymyslet nová témata k hovoru. I když už někoho znáš.#$e#... Promiň.",
      "sourceSHA256": "ae23c02487c18cdb6736275b3fd5504bb11310e719abc1b3e279ca1cac997dea",
      "translationSHA256": "a15ae81e90dca08722bd9de24a11b5fbd25416d1357d04193e1a062710ad939a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Tue6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I was so close to screaming at Mom for throwing away my old comic collection... But something stopped me.#$e#Hmm... with age comes wisdom.",
      "translation": "Málem jsem na mámu začal křičet, že vyhodila mou starou sbírku komiksů... Ale něco mě zastavilo.#$e#Hm... s věkem přichází moudrost.",
      "sourceSHA256": "46a92208006dd8cad020d3959fc8bc5c922846d09bf5d7744df64b57e882e8a1",
      "translationSHA256": "4035d26295ba4ec6956eefa48c7b33476a8fd81bc75d0e6bacb4f60dac7d7692",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Tue10",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You came here to see me?$l#$e#...$h",
      "translation": "Ty jsi tady kvůli mně?$l#$e#...$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "c49bf00295ba36b86580e5f12b834c4cda52a0a8b353912f04a3e05102f37b7a",
      "translationSHA256": "632e36bff6b375f52083f5027a9bff73cabce779cb59477bc89b79e339b83046",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "%Sebastian seems lost in thought...",
      "translation": "%Sebastian je pohroužený do myšlenek...",
      "sourceSHA256": "d017e0470b61ff42c4635bfa86c14d75c59cdf0fea3b1e26f8e3c6bc3d94fd30",
      "translationSHA256": "6606d0d67aeaa69c212ab9d5727d52b1329e41164634c1af4739ed91658dcc54",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Wed4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, don't let me stop you from getting your work done.#$e#If you aren't busy I don't mind if you stick around.$h",
      "translation": "Ahoj, kvůli mně práci neodkládej.#$e#Jestli nemáš nic na práci, klidně tu zůstaň.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "cf4b36765c6525747a9fb53b749a8158240bf90aa2384664322dcf7b618c90e4",
      "translationSHA256": "6e8311afaf458ea2ef33302d968553291c205e708c0d5c4d363d7014160eae2a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I wonder what's for dinner tonight... *grumble*$s",
      "translation": "Zajímalo by mě, co bude dnes k večeři... *zakručení v břiše*$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "d7e5a13a73c691cc5beb9e3cc5c6d056c83b5370457768c7f24de24f87ac4bb8",
      "translationSHA256": "72ee5eea1651e39c76c8f0d9e3372c268474964a7edd4b1b2f434b97dba40620",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Thu6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I should learn how to cook. That would be useful.",
      "translation": "Měl bych se naučit vařit. To by se hodilo.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c56d847af2494dd663d1aefe37d23b05d0c4967bab5e761952ac621ef9d9eea9",
      "translationSHA256": "1e6bcaab50a2152eb5be168a466164288afce5fe39668926d48962ad0e72dbe9",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's fun to live so close to the train tracks. It's a reminder that there's a big world out there.",
      "translation": "Je zábavné bydlet tak blízko železniční trati. Připomíná mi to, že tam venku je velký svět.",
      "sourceSHA256": "7005e63f4c25e4e90df632ec5aba53f6561dbdca0b024e298055d211c6390ce9",
      "translationSHA256": "42df2bddbf33514648f53027ebcf327d949633b64120d00f16549abc8d3b8c62",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Fri8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "When I was younger I'd run out to the railroad whenever I heard a train coming.#$e#Whatever happened to those days...? *sigh*$s",
      "translation": "Když jsem byl mladší, pokaždé jsem vyběhl k trati, jakmile jsem zaslechl přijíždějící vlak.#$e#Kam se ty časy poděly...? *povzdechne si*$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "43c3115e7faa57cf44fee503010433c49e36077b4005c6569b47fdf92e3304ac",
      "translationSHA256": "230b645cf380d5775d3ed594b931071ed8d3a54202423e4898c9e30321a98d53",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The frogs aren't very happy in winter.#$e#Poor little guys.$s||I wonder what the frogs do in winter? Do they just become frozen and then thaw out in spring?",
      "translation": "Žáby nejsou v zimě moc spokojené.#$e#Chudáčci.$s||Co asi žáby dělají v zimě? Prostě zmrznou a na jaře zase rozmrznou?",
      "sourceSHA256": "4e7539c059a3d8b84c3dca6eda37d03dcf55bd9191bed3cea02cc8ad4cb85eae",
      "translationSHA256": "5affe59a0ae5b3363f952b411b2ffd94d33e5bf3dd8d881711e738201e8ad12e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Sat6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I like winter but I do feel bad for all the cold animals out there.#$e#I guess they're used to it, though... like me.",
      "translation": "Mám rád zimu, ale je mi líto všech zvířat, která tam venku mrznou.#$e#Asi jsou na to ale zvyklá... stejně jako já.",
      "sourceSHA256": "27b87b0c1e58ca8ab0415f6230a9431aff6d5e6793d62620cf52eced47591c23",
      "translationSHA256": "0ec17503732c61555f68c6c944bc6d189cda9d2278e17f7c2ef3889cfd63286f",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I built a snowgoon but Demetrius made me get rid of it.#$e#What's his problem?$u",
      "translation": "Postavil jsem sněhulotra, ale Demetrius mě donutil, abych se ho zbavil.#$e#Co mu vadí?$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "39918bbda756ceff266c03525475a300ab9815ea35ef1898e9573f69f25abdb3",
      "translationSHA256": "01bde5b5d9124ba8489a65e371dcc5252541c3de4d9c4bd5514b1f52c1ddb713",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "winter_Sun6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I built a snowgoon but Demetrius made me get rid of it... yet Maru's cute little snowman goes unharmed!$a#$e#Ridiculous.",
      "translation": "Postavil jsem sněhulotra, ale Demetrius mě donutil, abych se ho zbavil... Zato Maru má roztomilého sněhuláka a tomu se nic nestane!$a#$e#Směšné.",
      "sourceSHA256": "ace7b7ff911a954714a035f7a29b6abae0746e439b8e3a50b259b7f07733d881",
      "translationSHA256": "5cb9872e36d15f38b23aeff91d55fc76d84ad965191dc32f7f6696a102453eca",
      "reviewChecks": [
